meta {
  name: Search Activities
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

docs {
  Searches for activities within a specified date range, scoped to the current sprint project.
  
  **Parameters**:
  - `startDate`: ISO 8601 start date (e.g., `2026-04-06`).
  - `endDate`: ISO 8601 end date.
  - `authoredOnly`: 
    - `true`: Returns only transactions **authored by** the target users.
    - `false`: Returns transactions **authored by** OR **addressed to** (@mentions) the target users.
  - `users`: (Optional) Comma-separated list of User UUIDs. Defaults to current caller.
  
  ### Database Mapping
  | API Field | DB Table | DB Column | Role |
  | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |
  | `id` | `activities` | `id` | Primary Key |
  | `userId` | `activities` | `user_id` | Foreign Key to `users.id` |
  | `title` | `activities` | `title` | Search keyword matches here |
  | `date` | `activities` | `date` | Actual activity occurrence date |
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/activities/search
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:query {
  startDate: 2026-04-06
  endDate: 2026-04-07
  authoredOnly: false
  users: {{targetUserId}}
}

tests {
  test("Status 200", function() {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
  });
}
